OL,3,GNEWSASisters buy 'lighthouses' to
OL,4,Aremember loved ones
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family have bought a chain of
OL,7,Flighthouse models in memory of loved
OL,8,Fones and to thank the hospice charity
OL,9,Fwhich cared for them.
OL,11,FSisters Kim Hill and Nicola Oliver
OL,12,Fbought the models which were sold at
OL,13,Fauction at the end of St Luke's Hospice
OL,14,FPlymouth's Guiding Lights trail.
OL,16,FThe women said they were inspired to
OL,17,Fbuy the lighthouses because of their
OL,18,Fpersonal experiences with the charity.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
